  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>At anode&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cu</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p>At cathode&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Ag</mi></math></p><p>Cell reaction&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Cu</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Ag</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>43</mn><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>001</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>46</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Ag</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Cu</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>46</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Cu</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Cu</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>34</mn></math> volt</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Cu</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p></blockquote>",
